    "detailed_description": "<h1>Alpha Registration Open</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">We are happy to announce that the game's alpha is open for registration!</h2>Reserve your spot and share the game with your friends - to make sure they will be able to play it with you.<br><br>In the alpha we have built the whole game loop (from Villain/Defender selection to either side's victory), the main map, locally hosted multiplayer and lot's and lot's of destruction. <br>We also have four defender classes you can choose from with their special abilities and few skins for the RTS monsters.<br><br>Join in on the fun!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Choose the role you wish to play in the world of Inequalis: gather your party and shoot down the enemy hordes as defender or bring chaos and sow destruction as the villain.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075090/extras/76171174e52d684dbbd424bf8065bff5.avif?t=1667385328\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075090/extras/2a395b2a06bcef7f85b297ad74eab5b4.poster.avif?t=1667385328\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075090/extras/2a395b2a06bcef7f85b297ad74eab5b4.webm?t=1667385328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075090/extras/2a395b2a06bcef7f85b297ad74eab5b4.mp4?t=1667385328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Playing in a first-person mode, you can defend your castle with up to 4 other player teammates against the solo Villain. Blast your way through the invading forces and banish the villain from your reality by performing mystical rituals.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075090/extras/f483b8e92261ee8af477fb119fdfc722.avif?t=1667385328\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075090/extras/5a99a8ce243d9f381b6b5fe2f3b22f70.poster.avif?t=1667385328\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075090/extras/5a99a8ce243d9f381b6b5fe2f3b22f70.webm?t=1667385328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075090/extras/5a99a8ce243d9f381b6b5fe2f3b22f70.mp4?t=1667385328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Playing in real-time strategy mode, you play alone against a team of 5. Control armies of monsters, sneaking, destroying, and overrunning the defenders. Destroy their castle with cunning or simple brute force, but do it before they complete the magic rituals.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075090/extras/bb55d38ffd841899db5c579697c0a90f.webp?t=1667385328\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075090/extras/f67b5bfc242970cc4b3fe218564123c8.avif?t=1667385328\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075090/extras/2ecbf72d0086c99158da916f6bcb2028.webp?t=1667385328\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Shoot and kill monsters - Stop them from destroying the town\u2019s gates and buildings<br></li><li>Coordinate with your teammates - Help each other to prevent the monster's entry<br></li><li>Complete all the rituals  - scattered around the map they seal the dark portals</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075090/extras/25723d16522b9fcc97fbb4a9c9093663.avif?t=1667385328\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075090/extras/ef2e0f4f80df1b87e52813be08c7b571.webp?t=1667385328\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sow Destruction - Starting with a few monsters, destroy buildings and players to gain chaos.<br></li><li>Build up your army - Spend chaos to increase your army\u2019s variety, numbers, and abilities<br></li><li>Strike the finishing blow - Overrun the defenders and destroy the heart of the castle</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075090/extras/b422728b998f3aabe355010dc8f9a1ec.poster.avif?t=1667385328\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075090/extras/b422728b998f3aabe355010dc8f9a1ec.webm?t=1667385328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075090/extras/b422728b998f3aabe355010dc8f9a1ec.mp4?t=1667385328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
